     interface if the host is multihomed.  If _i_m_r___i_f_i_n_d_e_x is non-zero, value
     of _i_m_r___i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e is ignored.  Otherwise, if _i_m_r___i_f_i_n_d_e_x is 0, kernel will
